"Delivered (commit 'Consistency is system-imposed'), scope GREW mid-flight per user direction to the full architecture: (1) canonical EquipmentComponent {armament_ids, worn_armor_id, worn_relic_ids} - stats read it alone; armor/relics components demoted to pure config (dirties removed); authored blobs born-converged (armament_names also fill default_armaments so NPCs are config carriers with matching intent). (2) reconciliation forces registered Rearm (new ActionType/effect/SpecialActionKey/pack field, prod re_arm) on divergence; intentional paths (try_adopt_stance, equip/unequip/take acts) converge immediately and clear/skip via the new stance_forced flag on forced transitions (intimidation, dive). (3) configuration_sanitation_system trims configs to counted inventory, players only, ordered before reconciliation. (4) action_validation_system sweeps invalid active+queued actions driven by action_queue_dirty (set by every ActionStateComponent mutation - one fixed mutation path), emitting renderable TargetLost; resolution-time failures of item/interact verbs become ActionFailed events; both narrated in both languages. Unequip validates configured-ness, equip carried-ness, split via the registry. KNOWN LIMIT recorded as action-queue-holds-automatic-and-manual-entries: single queue slot means forced rearm can displace a queued manual action; ordered queue with the automatic flag on entries is next. 67 e2e / 168 unit / 35 server tests green, clippy clean."